 $]',69497),(36176,'zhCN','第26部分','$[!16\n\n在史诗难度下，瘟疫浪潮会移除恶性肿瘤。$]',69497),(36176,'zhTW','第26區','$[!16\n\n在傳奇難度下，瘟疫波會摧毀惡意腫瘤。$]',69497),(36177,'deDE','Abschnitt 33','',69497),(36177,'esES','Sección 33','',69497),(36177,'esMX','Sección 33','',69497),(36177,'frFR','Section 33','',69497),(36177,'itIT','Sezione 33','',69497),(36177,'koKR','33구역','',69497),(36177,'ptBR','Seção 33','',69497),(36177,'ruRU','Раздел 33','',69497),(36177,'zhCN','第33部分','',69497),(36177,'zhTW','第33區','',69497),(36179,'deDE','Abschnitt 90','',69497),(36179,'esES','Sección 90','',69497),(36179,'esMX','Sección 90','',69497),(36179,'frFR','Section 90','',69497),(36179,'itIT','Sezione 90','',69497),(36179,'koKR','90구역','',69497),(36179,'ptBR','Seção 90','',69497),(36179,'ruRU','Раздел 90','',69497),(36179,'zhCN','第90部分','',69497),(36179,'zhTW','第90區','',69497),(36180,'deDE','Abschnitt 91','',69497),(36180,'esES','Sección 91','',69497),(36180,'esMX','Sección 91','',69497),(36180,'frFR','Section 91','',69497),(36180,'itIT','Sezione 91','',69497),(36180,'koKR','91구역','',69497),(36180,'ptBR','Seção 91','',69497),(36180,'ruRU','Раздел 91','',69497),(36180,'zhCN','第91部分','',69497),(36180,'zhTW','第91區','',69497),(36181,'deDE','Abschnitt 92','',69497),(36181,'esES','Sección 92','',69497),(36181,'esMX','Sección 92','',69497),(36181,'frFR','Section 92','',69497),(36181,'itIT','Sezione 92','',69497),(36181,'koKR','92구역','',69497),(36181,'ptBR','Seção 92','',69497),(36181,'ruRU','Раздел 92','',69497),(36181,'zhCN','第92部分','',69497),(36181,'zhTW','第92區','',69497),(36260,'deDE','Abschnitt 28','',69497),(36260,'esES','Sección 28','',69497),(36260,'esMX','Sección 28','',69497),(36260,'frFR','Section 28','',69497),(36260,'itIT','Sezione 28','',69497),(36260,'koKR','28구역','',69497),(36260,'ptBR','Seção 28','',69497),(36260,'ruRU','Раздел 28','',69497),(36260,'zhCN','第28部分','',69497),(36260,'zhTW','第28區','',69497),(36261,'deDE','Abschnitt 27','',69497),(36261,'esES','Sección 27','',69497),(36261,'esMX','Sección 27','',69497),(36261,'frFR','Section 27','',69497),(36261,'itIT','Sezione 27','',69497),(36261,'koKR','27구역','',69497),(36261,'ptBR','Seção 27','',69497),(36261,'ruRU','Раздел 27','',69497),(36261,'zhCN','第27部分','',69497),(36261,'zhTW','第27區','',69497),(36262,'deDE','Abschnitt 29','',69497),(36262,'esES','Sección 29','',69497),(36262,'esMX','Sección 29','',69497),(36262,'frFR','Section 29','',69497),(36262,'itIT','Sezione 29','',69497),(36262,'koKR','29구역','',69497),(36262,'ptBR','Seção 29','',69497),(36262,'ruRU','Раздел 29','',69497),(36262,'zhCN','第29部分','',69497),(36262,'zhTW','第29區','',69497),(36271,'deDE','Abschnitt 99','$[!16\n\n[Mythisch] Ein Teil des verdichteten Gifts verwandelt sich in virulente Mutationen. Das Wirken von \'Toxische Sintflut\' bringt alle verbleibenden virulenten Mutationen zu einer tödlichen Explosion.$]',69497),(36271,'esES','Sección 99','$[!16\n\nEn dificultad mítica, algunos venenos fusionados se transforman en mutaciones virulentas. Al lanzar Diluvio tóxico, las mutaciones virulentas que quedan explotan en una erupción mortífera.$]',69497),(36271,'esMX','Sección 99','$[!16\n\nEn dificultad mítica, parte del veneno coalescente se transforma en mutaciones virulentas. Al lanzarse, la inundación tóxica hace explotar las mutaciones virulentas restantes en una erupción mortal.$]',69497),(36271,'frFR','Section 99','$[!16\n\nEn mode mythique, certains venins amalgamés se transforment en mutations virulentes. Déluge toxique provoque l’explosion mortelle de toutes les mutations virulentes restantes à son incantation.$]',69497),(36271,'itIT','Sezione 99','$[!16\n\nIn modalità Mitica, parte del Veleno Condensato si trasforma in Mutazioni Virulente. Diluvio Tossico fa esplodere ogni Mutazione Virulenta rimasta in un\'eruzione letale, quando viene lanciato.$]',69497),(36271,'koKR','99구역','$[!16\n\n신화 난이도에서는 일부 응결된 맹독이 악성 돌연변이로 뒤틀립니다. 유독한 폭우가 시전되면 남은 모든 악성 돌연변이를 폭발시켜 치명적인 분출을 일으킵니다.$]',69497),(36271,'ptBR','Seção 99','$[!16\n\nNo modo Mítico, algumas Peçonhas Coalescidas se transformam em Mutações Virulentas. Dilúvio Tóxico detona quaisquer Mutações Virulentas restantes, causando uma explosão mortal.$]',69497),(36271,'ruRU','Раздел 99','$[!16\n\nВ эпохальном режиме часть сгустившегося яда превращается в заразный мутаген. При применении \"Ядовитого потопа\" все оставшиеся сгустки заразного мутагена взрываются, нанося очень высокий урон.$]',69497),(36271,'zhCN','第99部分','$[!16\n\n在史诗难度下，部分凝结的毒液会折跃成为烈毒变异体。施放剧毒洪流时，会引爆所有剩余的烈毒变异体，引发致命爆发。$]',69497),(36271,'zhTW','第99區','$[!16\n\n在傳奇難度下，部分聚合毒液會轉變成毒惡突變體。劇毒洪流被施放時，會使任何剩餘的毒惡突變體產生致命的爆發。$]',69497),(36279,'deDE','Abschnitt 91','',69497),(36279,'esES','Sección 91','',69497),(36279,'esMX','Sección 91','',69497),(36279,'frFR','Section 91','',69497),(36279,'itIT','Sezione 91','',69497),(36279,'koKR','91구역','',69497),(36279,'ptBR','Seção 91','',69497),(36279,'ruRU','Раздел 91','',69497),(36279,'zhCN','第91部分','',69497),(36279,'zhTW','第91區','',69497),(36280,'deDE','Abschnitt 95','',69497),(36280,'esES','Sección 95','',69497),(36280,'esMX','Sección 95','',69497),(36280,'frFR','Section 95','',69497),(36280,'itIT','Sezione 95','',69497),(36280,'koKR','95구역','',69497),(36280,'ptBR','Seção 95','',69497),(36280,'ruRU','Раздел 95','',69497),(36280,'zhCN','第95部分','',69497),(36280,'zhTW','第95區','',69497),(36283,'deDE','Abschnitt 42','',69497),(36283,'esES','Sección 42','',69497),(36283,'esMX','Sección 42','',69497),(36283,'frFR','Section 42','',69497),(36283,'itIT','Sezione 42','',69497),(36283,'koKR','42구역','',69497),(36283,'ptBR','Seção 42','',69497),(36283,'ruRU','Раздел 42','',69497),(36283,'zhCN','第42部分','',69497),(36283,'zhTW','第42區','',69497),(36284,'deDE','Abschnitt 43','',69497),(36284,'esES','Sección 43','',69497),(36284,'esMX','Sección 43','',69497),(36284,'frFR','Section 43','',69497),(36284,'itIT','Sezione 43','',69497),(36284,'koKR','43구역','',69497),(36284,'ptBR','Seção 43','',69497),(36284,'ruRU','Раздел 43','',69497),(36284,'zhCN','第43部分','',69497),(36284,'zhTW','第43區','',69497),(3